@title Large cabinet heat: runs as a reduced model and says so
@area Heat
# The crowded fixture (59 devices) needs 730 000 cells at full resolution; the run lumps its cold devices, widens ducts and rails to porous strips and still finishes. The legend names the reduced model and the convergence. Waits are real seconds: the solver runs on the wall clock.
open qa/fixtures/text-stress-cabinet.novo
wait 30
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Simulate heat of the cabinet
wait 4
key Enter
wait 20
shot heat-running
wait_s 40
shot legend-midrun
wait_s 200
expect "Reduced model"
shot heat-result
click_text "Reduced model"
wait 10
expect "Reduced model: "
shot legend-reduced-open
check_blank heat-result
check_layout
